  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$a=3 t+4$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{d V}{d t}=3 t+4 \\\\ & \\int_0^V d V=\\int_0^t(3 t+4) d t \\\\ & V=\\frac{3 t^2}{2}+4 t=\\frac{12}{2}+8=14 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
